{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Void of Lilly comes to Steam for free!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866140/extras/962084319678aed5151fc1d0b81a861d.poster.avif?t=1773817173\" width=640 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866140/extras/962084319678aed5151fc1d0b81a861d.webm?t=1773817173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866140/extras/962084319678aed5151fc1d0b81a861d.mp4?t=1773817173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long time ago, people faced the Black Fog disease. That's how Axis city became the last bastion of humanity. Years of progress within total isolation, and now it's a beautiful place, filled with advanced techologies. But you aren't really interested in all af this stuff, right? You just want to find your sister and bring her back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short story-focused game with a few JRPG elements, beautiful pixel art and BULLET-HELL-like battles!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866140/extras/4babcbe114b8d30612a3c64708c61510.poster.avif?t=1773817173\" width=640 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866140/extras/4babcbe114b8d30612a3c64708c61510.webm?t=1773817173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866140/extras/4babcbe114b8d30612a3c64708c61510.mp4?t=1773817173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Ann to find her sister in a short 60-120 minutes adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hack&quot; your enemies in Bullet Hell fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the world's mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866140/extras/2e58c0584ff628fef262967079ae852f.poster.avif?t=1773817173\" width=640 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866140/extras/2e58c0584ff628fef262967079ae852f.webm?t=1773817173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866140/extras/2e58c0584ff628fef262967079ae852f.mp4?t=1773817173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It's time to start!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866140/bb2b9711d35ead2c2cb598c6a61480cbefb4a78f.jpg"},{"name":"Bruteforce it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866140/4800c18bc8aea0e92614732eaf445828c52480b0.jpg"},{"name":"No Joy???","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866140/60c586f6bff71bd59bd37587ad85c30e46b7ccd6.jpg"},{"name":"Mid-boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866140/ed19d632a942b37def15abf60a15715557b06eb6.jpg"},{"name":"No one is watching","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866140/4f55476da616956ac53eacb2b90d7ff99228be69.jpg"},{"name":"White Knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866140/0254c6e623f99e8ce5ddc2255e05a7d6e65bd08b.jpg"},{"name":"Found you!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams